  "description": "<html>\n        <head>\n        \n        </head>\n        <body >\n        <div style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#111827; max-width:980px; margin:0 auto;\">\n<!-- START: Comic Description – Classroom of The Elite 1st Year -->\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:18px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">📚 Classroom of The Elite 1st Year Light Novel English Version Vol. 1–11.5 Full Set</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Enter the psychological school drama world of <strong>Classroom of The Elite</strong>, a popular light novel series by <strong>Syougo Kinugasa</strong> with artwork by <strong>Shunsaku Tomose</strong>, featuring strategy, class rivalry, hidden talent, and social mind games.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">✨ This listing is for <strong>Classroom of The Elite 1st Year Light Novel English Version</strong>, covering <strong>Volumes 1–11.5 / 14 Books</strong>. Condition: <strong>Brand New &amp; Sealed</strong>. Set Type: <strong>FULL SET</strong>. 🚚 Shipping available as stated in the listing.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #fecaca; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#fff1f2;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">📌 Important Edition Notice</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Please read carefully before purchasing. This is a <strong>local / underground reading edition</strong>, printed by <strong>Local Books Printing</strong>. It is <strong>NOT an official publisher edition</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">This book set is not from Viz Media, Square Enix, Kodansha, Yen Press, Tokyopop, Vertical, or similar official producers. It is <strong>not recommended / not suitable for collectors</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">This edition is suitable for <strong>first-time light novel readers, casual readers, and pleasure reading</strong>. The content follows the original story, but this is a local reading print by Local Books Printing. Official editions usually cost more.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Minor print, trim, colour, paper, cover, and finishing variations may occur due to local batch production.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 10px;\">✅ Quick Highlights</div>\n<div style=\"display:block;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 8px 0; background:#f9fafb;\">📚 FULL SET Vol. 1–11.5</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 8px 0; background:#f9fafb;\">🇬🇧 English Version</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 8px 0; background:#f9fafb;\">🆕 Brand New &amp; Sealed</span>\n<span style=\"display:inline-block; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:999px; padding:6px 10px; margin:0 6px 8px 0; background:#f9fafb;\">📘 Jacket Matte Laminate</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">📖 Story Overview</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\"><strong>Classroom of The Elite</strong> is set in Tokyo Metropolitan Advanced Nurturing High School, a prestigious school designed to train Japan’s top students. Behind its polished reputation, the school uses a strict merit-based system where class rank, points, privileges, and future opportunities depend on performance.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">Kiyotaka Ayanokoji enters Class 1-D, the lowest-ranked class. Although he appears quiet and ordinary, he hides exceptional intelligence and ability. As Class D faces tests, rival classes, alliances, betrayals, and psychological strategies, Kiyotaka becomes involved in a competitive school environment where every decision matters.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Volumes 1–11.5 cover the first-year story arc, making this set ideal for readers who enjoy school drama, psychological fiction, strategy, slice-of-life elements, hidden genius characters, and tense class competition.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">📌 Key Details</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li><strong>Title / Series:</strong> Classroom of The Elite 1st Year</li>\n<li><strong>Volumes:</strong> 1–11.5 / 14 Books</li>\n<li><strong>Set Type:</strong> FULL SET</li>\n<li><strong>Language:</strong> English</li>\n<li><strong>Author / Artist:</strong> Syougo Kinugasa / Shunsaku Tomose</li>\n<li><strong>Genre:</strong> Drama, Fiction, Slice of Life, Psychological, School, Strategy</li>\n<li><strong>Format:</strong> Light novel text-based reading edition with jacket matte laminate</li>\n<li><strong>Condition:</strong> Brand New &amp; Sealed</li>\n<li><strong>Publisher / Printing:</strong> Local / underground printing by Local Books Printing</li>\n<li><strong>Intended Use:</strong> Reading copy, not suitable for collectors</li>\n<li><strong>Shipping:</strong> Shipping available as stated in the listing</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">✨ Edition &amp; Quality Notes</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">This is a budget-friendly local reading edition made for readers who want to enjoy the full first-year story in English. It is not an official publisher edition and is best purchased as a casual reading copy.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin:0 0 8px; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>Softcover / paperback light novel format with jacket matte laminate.</li>\n<li>Text-based light novel pages with English text.</li>\n<li>Minor print, trim, cover, binding, paper, and finishing variations may occur.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin:0; color:#6b7280; font-size:12.5px;\">Collector warning: This local reading edition is not recommended for collectors who require official publisher copies, exact print quality, official ISBN matching, or premium collectible finishing.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">🎨 Colour &amp; Display Note</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Actual book colour, cover shade, print tone, and finishing may look slightly different due to monitor settings, lighting conditions during photography, and batch production variations.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">🎁 Packaging &amp; Protection</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">We pack light novel sets carefully to reduce movement and help protect the books during transit.</p>\n<ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>Volumes are grouped securely before packing.</li>\n<li>Bubble wrap or protective material is used.</li>\n<li>Sturdy outer packaging is used for safer delivery.</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">📌 Important Buyer Notes</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>This is a local reading edition, not an official publisher edition.</li>\n<li>Not suitable for collectors.</li>\n<li>Official editions usually cost more.</li>\n<li>Please message before buying if unsure.</li>\n<li>Please confirm set type / range before purchase: <strong>FULL SET Vol. 1–11.5</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">🚚 Shipping</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>Item will be packed securely before dispatch.</li>\n<li>Tracking will be provided once the order has been shipped.</li>\n<li>Delivery time may vary depending on destination country, courier handling, and customs processing.</li>\n<li>Buyer is responsible for checking import rules, customs duty, tax, or local delivery requirements if applicable.</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">↩️ Returns</div>\n<ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>Please contact us first if there is any issue with your order.</li>\n<li>Returned items should be in the same condition as received.</li>\n<li>Buyer must check the listing details carefully before purchasing, especially edition type, condition, and set type.</li>\n<li>Return handling follows the return policy shown on the eBay listing.</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 14px; background:#ffffff;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 8px;\">⭐ Feedback</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Your satisfaction is important to us. If you are happy with your purchase, positive feedback is greatly appreciated. If there is any problem, please contact us before leaving feedback so we can assist you properly.</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:16px; padding